est friends.</summary></entry><entry><title>Like father, daughter, brother and nephew: Meet the firefighting family</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn0jn693ed3o#2</id><updated>2026-09-27T14:09:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T05:33:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn0jn693ed3o--dad2467e1955.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn0jn693ed3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Over the years, proud firefighter Philip Gould has been joined by four other members of his family.</summary></entry><entry><title>'I was angry at my husband - I didn't know he had dementia'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T14:08:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:21:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o--4f194afb78ee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Helen Beaumont was told her husband was depressed. In fact he had young onset dementia.</summary></entry><entry><title>Why saunas are becoming the new dating hotspot</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8vgy7wq45xno#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T14:09:09Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:31:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8vgy7wq45xno--3ddd21734868.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8vgy7wq45xno?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">From first dates to speed dating, saunas have become a popular place to meet a new partner.</summary></entry><entry><title>'You never know': The people preparing for the worst</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwyvzlvq5e18o#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T14:09:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T05:27